 215:Src/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   /* Line Coding Structure                                                       */
 216:Src/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   /*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
 217:Src/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   /* Offset | Field       | Size | Value  | Description                          */
